**Explanation:**
- The patch adds an event listener for `root.set` (the event fired when the canvas root/plane is changed).
- It first removes all existing drilldown overlays (to avoid duplicates).
- Then, it adds overlays for all elements in the new root that can drill down (i.e., collapsed subprocesses).
- This ensures overlays are always correct when navigating between diagrams/planes, fixing the bug described.

